# BANNERFALL: a bowman shoots the first enemy down its row and doesn't move;
# a warden at 4+ HP shrugs arrows off, below that they hurt.
game bannerfall
wait 5
cheat battle 18
cheat clear
cheat unit 0 2 2 0
cheat unit 6 2 1 1
cheat unit 0 3 2 0
cheat unit 6 3 3 1
cheat unit 0 4 2 0
cheat unit 6 4 3 1 3
cheat resolve
expect unit_at02 == 2
expect hp_at52 == 2
expect hp_at53 == 5
expect hp_at54 == 2
# arrows fly over allies
cheat clear
cheat unit 0 1 2 0
cheat unit 2 1 3 0
cheat unit 6 1 1 1
cheat resolve
expect hp_at51 == 2
expect hp_at31 == 5
